the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and  house of the dragon update video in this  video i want to go over another one of  variety's articles from their website in  this article we found out what actor  steve tousant had to say about the fan's  backlash regarding his character as i'm  sure most of you already know by now  there's still a lot of a song of ice and  fire fans who are very upset with hbo  for hiring a black man as laura corliss  velaryon as a matter of fact they've  been angry with this ever since hbo  officially announced who landed the role  as the legendary sea snake  well in this new article house of the  dragons star steve dusant had a few  words for the fire and blood readers who  can't stomach the fact that hbo hired  him instead of a white man now although  he did not have a lot to say on the  matter i still want to show all of you  what was actually said let's have a look  at their article now it says house of  the dragon star steve toussaint spoke  out against a backlash from some readers  who criticized his casting as famed  sailor lorcorlus velaryon aka the sea  snake  this outrage stems from the fact that  this character the husband of rhaenys  targaryen is not a black man in george r  martin's novel fire and blood which is  what the game of thrones series is based  on the actor goes on to say as we spoke  about yesterday other than certain fans  thoughts about someone who looks like me  playing this part it hasn't really  affected the role in my experience on  the job with my fellow actors as i've  said before there are a song of ice and  fire fans outside who find it a little  hard to stomach that someone who looks  like me would be lord cordless velaryon  however that's an issue they have to  deal with and i don't have to the issue  for me is always the same i just have to  say the lines convincingly and avoid  bumping into the furniture now as you  all know george rr martin is working  directly with hbo and house of the  dragon showrunners ryan condell and  miguel sapochnick he has been working  with them on this new show every step of  the way since house of the dragons  inception now the way i see it is if the  author himself doesn't mind that a black  man is stepping into the shoes of lord  corliss velaryon then i don't see how  any of the fans should have something to  say about it the author the creator of a  song of ice and fire doesn't mind how  they've gone in this direction  for all we know it might have even been  george rr martin who went to hbo and  said they should make lorcorlos valeria  on a black man now let's be honest here  none of us actually know what's  happening behind the scenes unless  someone comes out and says otherwise  most of us should already know what  george rr martin will do if he's very  unhappy with how they're handling one of  his characters during the making of game  of thrones writers david and dan made so  many different additions or should i say  subtractions to the character of jane  westerling he actually made them switch  her entire name to something else  because he wasn't liking what they had  done  in george rr martin's novels rob stark  got married to jane westerling but in  game of thrones her name was talisa he  made them do this because he did not  want his fans thinking they were the  same characters now don't you think he  would do the same thing to lure corliss  velaryon if he actually didn't like this  idea i think this is another good sign  that he actually signs off on what  they've done otherwise he might not go  by the same name now if you ask me i  actually like the addition because it  does make him stand out from the rest  which makes him even more interesting  not only that but i even think he is the  most badass looking character on the  show i'm very excited to see what he  will do  now obviously i've only seen a few  seconds of him on the screen in each of  the teasers and trailers but it already  looks like he's done an amazing job i  hope that at least some of you will  begin to see it this way as well i think  he will win over some of the naysayers  if they at least give the man a damn  chance leave me some of your thoughts  down below i'm always interested in  hearing what you have to say as always i  want to thank everyone for stopping by  and watching the short update video i  hope all of you will subscribe so you  can be the first to know whenever i drop  a new video there are a lot more heading  your way for now have a great day  everyone i will see you again very soon  bye  you

